Questionnaire adoption strategy:\par
- Perceived value items: adapt from the English item table in Amado-Mateus et al. (2023), while acknowledging the scale lineage from Ledden et al. (2011).\par
- Trust items: adapt from Ohanian (1990) using the trustworthiness/expertise logic where appropriate.\par
- Vignette manipulations for recognition, stackability, and endorsement: self-develop them from policy and design sources such as OECD, European Commission, and Reed et al. (2024). This is defensible because manipulations are often theory-built rather than directly borrowed.\par
